ns to make Blurg Runners. This is a multiplayer game where you can play different gamemodes, hang out, and run for your life. This game is just starting and has a long way to go.", "short_description": "Blurg Runners is a game which the player you play as is inspired by a character is the game similar named \"Fun Monkey Horror 2\" by Zeophyte."}]}, "developer_name": "IHCUT", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/blurgrunners/privacy-policy?authuser=1", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "IHCUT", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/blurgrunners/home?authuser=1", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "39974909282152801"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/613090345_1114566291416690_1319850631350991161_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wk7k7KrQd00Q7kNvwHRGzFh&_nc_oc=AdpLqKQCujeDOnXHbGid9jtuAqfGZsZA5j8335QSvXK01NICSov-Kxzm2QT4VqGTpXw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXjyjZiWF2tg2i3FxCioXdILANXml0pxBuO0u_c4G4UdQ&oe=6B0EF2A1"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Blurg Runners", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_